WEBVTT

00:00:03.014 --> 00:00:04.415
Uh...

00:00:04.516 --> 00:00:06.384
- (horns honking)
- (yells, stammers)

00:00:06.484 --> 00:00:08.152
- (horns continue honking)
- Move it!

00:00:08.253 --> 00:00:09.754
(chuckling):
Sorry. My bad.

00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:13.291
I'm going. All right, I'm going.

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:16.427
Ooh. Glassos.

00:00:17.128 --> 00:00:18.863
(chattering, laughing)

00:00:18.964 --> 00:00:20.765
- (shouts in Minionese)
- (screams)

00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:22.166
(groans)

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:24.970
- (grunting)
- (barking)

00:00:25.069 --> 00:00:26.871
(whimpering)

00:00:26.972 --> 00:00:28.740
(laughs, speaks Minionese)

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.141
- (leash snaps)
- (screams)

00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:31.843
(barking, snarling)

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:33.077
(whimpering)

00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:35.613
(grunting rapidly)

00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:37.715
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:37.815 --> 00:00:38.951
(grunts, screams)

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.419
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:42.854 --> 00:00:44.188
(muffled chattering)

00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:47.392
All right, gentlemen, fall in.

00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:51.229
Some of you may be wondering
why you're here.

00:00:51.329 --> 00:00:52.897
- MINION: Uh...
- MINION 2: Si.

00:00:52.998 --> 00:00:54.967
As you may or may not know,

00:00:55.066 --> 00:00:56.501
I was recently called out
of retirement

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:59.671
to head up the AVL's
new top secret initiative

00:00:59.771 --> 00:01:02.106
to take down Maxime Le Mal.

00:01:02.206 --> 00:01:03.976
And that's where you come in.

00:01:04.075 --> 00:01:05.643
We need volunteers.

00:01:05.743 --> 00:01:07.378
(all shouting, laughing)

00:01:07.478 --> 00:01:09.881
We are looking for the strong,
the mighty...

00:01:09.982 --> 00:01:11.115
- Oh.
- Uh...

00:01:11.215 --> 00:01:12.450
- ...the fearless.
- MINION: Uh, nope.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.153
- We need the best of the best.
- Uh...

00:01:15.253 --> 00:01:18.122
- So, who's it going to be?
- (Minion chuckles)

00:01:18.222 --> 00:01:20.792
(Minions murmuring,
chuckling nervously)

00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:22.293
Yes, nice work, gentlemen.

00:01:22.393 --> 00:01:24.495
- Uh, blumach.
- (sighing)

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:25.830
(laughter)

00:01:25.931 --> 00:01:27.398
The AVL is known

00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:29.667
for cutting-edge weapons
and vehicles,

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:32.704
but now we are developing
cutting-edge agents,

00:01:32.804 --> 00:01:36.976
and I can think of no better
guinea pigs than you.

00:01:37.076 --> 00:01:38.643
- Guinea pig! Yeah!
- (laughing)

00:01:38.743 --> 00:01:39.677
(blows raspberry)

00:01:39.777 --> 00:01:43.082
You will be the first
to test our Super-serum,

00:01:43.181 --> 00:01:45.617
designed to transform you
into elite agents

00:01:45.717 --> 00:01:50.421
with powers and abilities
far beyond those of mortal man.

00:01:51.789 --> 00:01:54.026
Or you might just explode.

00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:55.793
We don't really know.

00:01:55.893 --> 00:01:57.096
Uh, uh, huh?

00:01:57.195 --> 00:01:58.863
(whimpers, yelps)

00:01:58.964 --> 00:02:00.531
(screaming)

00:02:00.632 --> 00:02:02.567
Ah... (chuckles)

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:06.604
(whirring)

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:08.773
- (electrical crackling)
- (Minions grunting rapidly)

00:02:08.873 --> 00:02:10.808
(grunts)

00:02:10.908 --> 00:02:12.510
(hollers, growls)

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.711
(yells)

00:02:14.913 --> 00:02:16.681
(laughing)

00:02:16.781 --> 00:02:18.282
(giggles, yells)

00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:22.420
(grunts, strains)

00:02:25.657 --> 00:02:27.225
(grunting)

00:02:27.325 --> 00:02:29.293
(speaks Minionese)

00:02:31.829 --> 00:02:34.232
(chuckling woozily)

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.634
(yelling fiercely)

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:41.472
Ladies and gentlemen,
I give you the Mega Minions.

00:02:41.572 --> 00:02:45.343
- (yelling, roaring)
- (Minions whooping)

00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:49.881
(entry bell jingles)

00:02:49.982 --> 00:02:51.150
(laughing):
Cool!

00:02:51.249 --> 00:02:53.451
Aw, you guys look adorable.

00:02:53.551 --> 00:02:55.586
And-and really tough
and-and scary.

00:02:55.687 --> 00:02:57.923
I'll look even better
when I have a black belt.

00:02:58.023 --> 00:02:59.390
Hi-yah!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.260
Ooh, ooh! I'm gonna break
a brick with my head.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.662
- That's the spirit. Oh!
- (gong clangs)

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.899
Oh, okay, now, go have fun
while I'm at work.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.902
Blair and Britney, right?

00:03:11.003 --> 00:03:12.704
- Mm...
- We will!

00:03:12.804 --> 00:03:14.472
Okay. Bye, Mom.

00:03:14.572 --> 00:03:15.840
- LUCY: Bye!
- (kids grunting)

00:03:15.941 --> 00:03:17.009
Gotcha.

00:03:17.109 --> 00:03:18.776
Hi-yah!

00:03:18.876 --> 00:03:20.611
Circle up, people.

00:03:21.412 --> 00:03:23.214
(grunting fiercely)

00:03:23.314 --> 00:03:25.516
Show respect for your sensei.

00:03:26.151 --> 00:03:28.720
KIDS:
Yes, Sensei O'Sullivan!

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.488
Hai!

00:03:33.959 --> 00:03:37.196
You, Moscovitch, didn't I
tell you to cut that hair?

00:03:37.295 --> 00:03:39.031
You look like a sheepdog.

00:03:39.131 --> 00:03:40.398
Sorry, Sensei.

00:03:40.498 --> 00:03:42.134
(Agnes whimpers,
chuckles nervously)

00:03:42.233 --> 00:03:43.936
Now, we have
two new students today

00:03:44.036 --> 00:03:48.974
ready to begin their journey--
hi-yah! -- to awesomeness.

00:03:49.074 --> 00:03:51.342
- You, tiny girl.
- (gasps)

00:03:51.442 --> 00:03:53.745
Step forward
and tell us your name.

00:03:53.845 --> 00:03:55.246
Um...

00:03:55.346 --> 00:03:57.515
(whispers):
It's Britney.

00:03:57.615 --> 00:03:59.084
Uh...

00:03:59.184 --> 00:04:01.385
m-my name?

00:04:02.221 --> 00:04:04.322
I can't...

00:04:04.422 --> 00:04:06.959
There's no "can't" in karate.

00:04:07.059 --> 00:04:09.360
Ten push-ups after class!

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.395
Hey, that's not fair.

00:04:12.097 --> 00:04:13.464
(grunting)

00:04:13.564 --> 00:04:16.168
You better not be talking back
to your sensei.

00:04:16.267 --> 00:04:17.769
(grunts fiercely)

00:04:17.869 --> 00:04:21.672
Now, are you ready to tell us
your name and participate?

00:04:21.773 --> 00:04:23.674
Mm...

00:04:23.775 --> 00:04:25.309
I guess not.

00:04:25.409 --> 00:04:27.378
Then why don't you go sit

00:04:27.478 --> 00:04:29.747
in the corner
of disgrace and reflection

00:04:29.847 --> 00:04:32.884
and think about what kind
of person you want to be?

00:04:37.555 --> 00:04:41.726
Now, am I gonna get
any trouble from you?

00:04:41.826 --> 00:04:43.427
Yeah, probably.

00:04:43.528 --> 00:04:44.729
- Excuse me?
- (neck cracks)

00:04:44.829 --> 00:04:47.398
If you think I'm above
fighting children,

00:04:47.498 --> 00:04:50.401
you picked the wrong dojo.

00:04:51.302 --> 00:04:53.571
(grunting fiercely)

00:04:56.374 --> 00:04:57.575
(grunts threateningly)

00:04:57.675 --> 00:04:59.844
- (Edith grunts)
- (screams)

00:04:59.945 --> 00:05:01.046
(groans)

00:05:01.146 --> 00:05:02.713
(gong clangs)

00:05:02.814 --> 00:05:04.116
(kids gasping)

00:05:04.216 --> 00:05:06.952
(kids cheering)

00:05:07.052 --> 00:05:08.954
That was for my sister.

00:05:09.054 --> 00:05:10.855
(O'Sullivan yells)

00:05:10.956 --> 00:05:12.157
(whimpers)

00:05:12.257 --> 00:05:14.859
You broke my pinkie toe.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:15.994
(whimpers)

00:05:16.094 --> 00:05:17.196
(Edith chuckles nervously)

00:05:17.296 --> 00:05:19.198
That's gonna be
a lot of push-ups.

00:05:19.298 --> 00:05:20.498
(Edith chuckles nervously)

00:05:20.598 --> 00:05:22.600
LUCY(quietly):
Okay, put this over here.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.501
Hair gel.

00:05:23.601 --> 00:05:25.237
- Hairspray.
- Oh, uh, Mrs. Cunningham.

00:05:25.336 --> 00:05:27.239
Oh, yeah, uh, yeah? Uh, um, hi.

00:05:27.338 --> 00:05:30.309
I have to say,
this is quite a résumé.

00:05:30.408 --> 00:05:32.177
Well, what can I say?

00:05:32.277 --> 00:05:33.644
I'm good at what I do.
(chuckles)

00:05:33.744 --> 00:05:36.514
Well, you are exactly
what we need here.

00:05:36.614 --> 00:05:39.151
Lot of vain, demanding divas
in this town.

00:05:39.251 --> 00:05:41.320
(both laugh)

00:05:41.419 --> 00:05:42.353
(entry bell jingles)

00:05:42.453 --> 00:05:44.323
I have a hair emergency, people.

00:05:44.422 --> 00:05:48.060
Where's what's-her-name?
Remy? Rhonda?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.962
Oh, Melora, I'm so sorry.

00:05:50.062 --> 00:05:51.429
Rachel's on maternity leave.

00:05:51.529 --> 00:05:53.932
What?! Oh, that is unacceptable.

00:05:54.032 --> 00:05:59.104
But you are in luck, because
Blanche here is fantastic.

00:05:59.204 --> 00:06:01.572
Perfect. I'll be in my chair.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.408
Okay, kiddo, you're up.

00:06:04.508 --> 00:06:06.245
- (chuckles nervously)
- ♪ Let's go!

00:06:06.345 --> 00:06:08.247
("Dynamite" by BTS playing)

00:06:08.347 --> 00:06:11.950
So, Melora,
what are we thinking?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.987
What if we just wet the hair
and let it dry in the air?

00:06:15.087 --> 00:06:17.555
(chuckling): Let nature do
its "thang," you know?

00:06:17.655 --> 00:06:20.292
No, no, no, no,
that style is dead to me.

00:06:20.391 --> 00:06:23.128
It's-it's time for
a whole new Melora.

00:06:23.228 --> 00:06:25.297
I want this.

00:06:25.429 --> 00:06:27.199
Wow. (chuckles)

00:06:27.299 --> 00:06:29.533
Wow. Um...

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:33.471
Okay. Let's start with color.

00:06:33.571 --> 00:06:36.407
Yes, color, 'cause that's
what you start with.

00:06:38.176 --> 00:06:40.212
A little of this.

00:06:40.312 --> 00:06:41.980
Some of that.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.414
And, ooh, that's pretty.

00:06:43.514 --> 00:06:45.017
This isn't so hard. (chuckles)

00:06:45.117 --> 00:06:47.052
(sizzling)

00:06:47.152 --> 00:06:48.886
Uh...

